    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Unlikely Duo: Bepp and Gola \u2013 Leave the City's Troubles to Them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is under siege by pollution-spreading monsters, and broken power lines have plunged it into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the constant chaos, Bepp the street cleaner and Gola the electrician join forces to bring the city back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, this professional duo sweeps away the grime and restores the light of hope, paving the way for the city's brighter future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Two Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/6963d5f4b7c11ebbe99975e4b35c4a3b.avif?t=1741160409\" width=96 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bepp the Street Cleaner</strong><br>Armed with his trusty cleaning tools, Bepp takes on the pollution monsters with the precision of a pro.<br>Keeping the city clean is his mission \u2013 when it comes to cleaning, you can count on Bepp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/89252832d023f9044f79a253bd0a3ade.avif?t=1741160409\" width=96 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gola the Electrician</strong><br>A specialist in fixing broken power lines and bringing light back to the city.<br>Though she can't directly fight the monsters, her work shines a light against the darkness and guides the city toward a brighter tomorrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan the duo's movements and control time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/c4d782d6063f821d35c2c6901feba390.poster.avif?t=1741160409\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/c4d782d6063f821d35c2c6901feba390.webm?t=1741160409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique system where players place actions on a timeline and control characters as if programming them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By moving both characters simultaneously and utilizing their distinct roles, players can solve the puzzles embedded within each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the ability to freely fast-forward and rewind time allows for trial and error, making it enjoyable to discover the optimal solution.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Unlikely Duo: Bepp and Gola \u2013 Leave the City's Troubles to Them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is under siege by pollution-spreading monsters, and broken power lines have plunged it into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the constant chaos, Bepp the street cleaner and Gola the electrician join forces to bring the city back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, this professional duo sweeps away the grime and restores the light of hope, paving the way for the city's brighter future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Two Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/6963d5f4b7c11ebbe99975e4b35c4a3b.avif?t=1741160409\" width=96 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bepp the Street Cleaner</strong><br>Armed with his trusty cleaning tools, Bepp takes on the pollution monsters with the precision of a pro.<br>Keeping the city clean is his mission \u2013 when it comes to cleaning, you can count on Bepp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/89252832d023f9044f79a253bd0a3ade.avif?t=1741160409\" width=96 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gola the Electrician</strong><br>A specialist in fixing broken power lines and bringing light back to the city.<br>Though she can't directly fight the monsters, her work shines a light against the darkness and guides the city toward a brighter tomorrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan the duo's movements and control time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/c4d782d6063f821d35c2c6901feba390.poster.avif?t=1741160409\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491720/extras/c4d782d6063f821d35c2c6901feba390.webm?t=1741160409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique system where players place actions on a timeline and control characters as if programming them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By moving both characters simultaneously and utilizing their distinct roles, players can solve the puzzles embedded within each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the ability to freely fast-forward and rewind time allows for trial and error, making it enjoyable to discover the optimal solution.</p>",
